== 7. Errors with try
7a. FileNotFound: inox-file-io-missing.txt
7a. ensure
7b. On IOError catches FileNotFound
7c. AlreadyExists: inox-file-io-copy.txt already exists
7c. the source is still there: true
7d. attempt 1: missing, creating it
7d. attempt 2: created by the handler
7e. Else: reading a file opened for writing
7f. IOError: closed file
7g. IOError: Create of a directory
7g. IOError: DeleteFile never deletes a directory
7h. FileNotFound: the folder does not exist
7i. RangeError caught; in the file: written before the exception
7j. inner: FileNotFound, raising again
7j. inner ensure
7j. outer: IOError
